"  • `wrap` is done                                                                                  "
"  • `keys` is done                                                                                  "
"enter        send the message                                                                       "
"shift+enter  newline (ctrl+j · alt+enter · \ enter)                                                 "
"esc          close dialog, panel or menu · interrupt                                                "
"ctrl+c       interrupt · clear input · twice to exit                                                "
"ctrl+d       exit on an empty input                                                                 "
"up/down      prompt history at the first and last line                                              "
"ctrl+a/e     start / end of the line (home · end)                                                   "
"alt+b/f      move one word                                                                          "
"ctrl+w/u/k   delete word · to line start · to line end                                              "
"pgup/pgdn    scroll the transcript                                                                  "
"ctrl+g       switch to a sub-agent's view                                                           "
"ctrl+t       plugin state (tasks, rooms)                                                            "
"tab          complete the command under the caret                                                   "
"shift+tab    cycle permission mode                                                                  "
"1-9 · y/a/n  answer the open dialog                                                                 "
"ctrl+e       expand the dialog's preview                                                            "
"/ · !        run a command · run a shell line                                                       "
"?            toggle this panel                                                                      "
"                                                                                                    "
"/help    shortcuts and commands                                                                     "
"/clear   start a fresh session here                                                                 "
"/resume  reopen a session                                                                           "
"/exit    leave bingo                                                                                "
"/quit    leave bingo                                                                                "
"╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮"
"│ > ask anything · / for commands · ! for shell                                                    │"
"╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯"
"? for shortcuts · / commands · ! shell                                                        fake-1"
